-# Static sample of Guidance+Rating Matrix for page help (not live data).
.border.rounded.p-3.bg-white
  %p.small.fw-semibold.mb-2 Example: Guidance+Rating Matrix
  %p.small.text-muted.mb-3
    Names match the Example column in the pattern table above.

  .table-responsive.mb-0
    %table.table.table-bordered.mb-0.small
      %thead
        %tr
          %th.align-middle.text-muted Guidance ↑ / Actual →
          %th.text-center Developing
          %th.text-center Accomplished
          %th.text-center Exceptional
      %tbody
        %tr
          %th.align-middle.text-success Exceptional guidance
          %td.text-center
            %span.badge.rounded-pill.text-bg-warning Blake
          %td.text-center
            %span.badge.rounded-pill.text-bg-info Nina
          %td.text-center
            %span.badge.rounded-pill.text-bg-success Maya
        %tr
          %th.align-middle.text-primary Accomplished guidance
          %td.text-center.text-muted ...
          %td.text-center
            %span.badge.rounded-pill.text-bg-primary Casey
          %td.text-center
            %span.badge.rounded-pill.text-bg-success Elena
        %tr
          %th.align-middle.text-warning Developing guidance
          %td.text-center
            %span.badge.rounded-pill.text-bg-warning Riley
          %td.text-center.text-muted ...
          %td.text-center
            %span.badge.rounded-pill.text-bg-success Quinn
